WEBVTT

00:02:29.687 --> 00:02:30.688
or you can’t.

00:02:30.688 --> 00:02:33.024
And that can be really 
disempowering to people,

00:02:33.024 --> 00:02:34.400
and it’s really discouraging

00:02:34.400 --> 00:02:35.401
and it makes them --

00:02:35.401 --> 00:02:39.197
in a period of time
that’s already stressful --

00:02:39.197 --> 00:02:40.615
can make you feel even worse.

00:02:40.615 --> 00:02:41.657
[Talk to parents]

00:02:42.575 --> 00:02:48.623
Asking a coworker
about how things are going at home

00:02:48.623 --> 00:02:49.665
or with their kid,

00:02:49.665 --> 00:02:52.251
making people feel like
they don’t have to hide that.

00:02:52.251 --> 00:02:53.961
“What’s up with your two-year-old?”

00:02:53.961 --> 00:02:55.713
Ask to see a picture of their child.

00:02:55.713 --> 00:02:56.756
[Be flexible]

00:02:57.632 --> 00:03:03.679
For parents, the hours between 5-8pm
are really crucial.